<title>HUNGARY: CESI index drops 1.24 percent, ends at 1,474.95pts.</title>
<headline>CESI index drops 1.24 percent, ends at 1,474.95pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index fell 1.24 percent or 18.59 points to 1,474.95 points on Monday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
